    "collapsible-content": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible-row-3": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Benefits",
            "icon": "lightning_bolt",
            "row_content": "<p>✔ Remove and prevent all types of stains & yellow teeth.<\/p><p>✔  Effectively eliminate the damage on teeth from coffee, wine, and more for a pristine smile.<\/p><p>✔ Get teeth dentist-smooth & squeaky clean.<\/p><p>✔ Achieve a dentist-approved, ultra-smooth, and fresh-clean feeling for your teeth.<\/p><p>✔ Gentle on enamel and gums, with no abrasiveness.<\/p><p>✔ Recognised as the top Teeth Whitener of 2023!<\/p><p>✔ Safe & natural ingredients for peace of mind<\/p><p>✔ Enjoy a 6-month supply of whitening per container.<\/p><p>✔ Achieve a noticeably brighter smile in just a few uses<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible-row-0": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "List of ingredients",
            "icon": "leaf",
            "row_content": "<p>Calcium Carbonate, Cyclodextrin, Sodium Bicarbonate, Xylitol, Phtalimidoperoxycaproic Acid (PAP), Sodium Cocoyl Isethionate, Tetrasodium Pyrophosphate, Hydroxyapatite (nano), Mica (Ci77019), PVP, Phenoxyethanol, Mint Flavour (Aroma), Potassium Citrate,  Sucralose, Menthol, Water, Monosodium Citrate, Ethylhexyglycerin<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible-row-1": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What's in the box?",
            "icon": "box",
            "row_content": "<p>Each order of PAP+ Teeth Whitening Powder consists of:<\/p><p>1x Premium Box Packaging<\/p><p>1x PAP+ Teeth Whitening Powder <\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "dc156c5a-46c9-43e5-acbd-475340353fc0": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Instructions",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Wondering how you can get the most out of your PAP+ Teeth Whitening Powder?<\/p><p>There's two ways to using the Teeth Whitening Powder:<\/p><p>1) Start by applying your toothpaste, and then gently dip your toothbrush with the toothpaste into the PAP+ Powder.<\/p><p>2) Alternatively, you can use it as a prelude to your daily brushing routine. Simply dip your toothbrush into the powder, brush your teeth vigorously for 2 minutes, and then proceed with your regular brushing regimen.<\/p><p>Recommended usage time: 3x per week<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "2eef6090-250f-48ad-a4ec-4aacca83c975": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can the Teeth Whitening Powder be used on composite bonding, veneer or fillings?",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes, the Teeth Whitening Powder is suitable for use on composite bonding, veneers, and fillings. While it is gentle on all types of dental work, it effectively removes surface stains from your teeth. The formula is designed to enhance your smile by brightening your natural teeth without compromising the integrity of your dental restorations.<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
